# Retail: Return request triage

Load examples/business/data/return_request.txt as Return Request
Alias Return Request as Return Form

Find order id and save as order_id
Find sku and save as sku
Find return reason and save as return_reason
Find purchase amount and save as purchase_amount

If order_id is missing
  return_status equals "needs review"
Otherwise
  return_status equals "processable"

purchase_amount must be at least 1

Route return_status to return_ops_queue
